('nice-err50','{"description":"Leveling signal পরপর হারিয়ে যাওয়া","subcodes":[{"code":"101","description":"পরপর তিনবার leveling signal আটকে যাওয়া (stuck) শনাক্ত হয়েছে।","solution":["Leveling ও door zone sensor ঠিকমতো কাজ করছে কি না দেখুন।","Leveling plate-এর installation verticality ও depth দেখুন।","MCB-এর leveling signal input point গুলো দেখুন।","Steel rope slip করছে কি না দেখুন।"]},{"code":"102","description":"পরপর তিনবার leveling signal loss শনাক্ত হয়েছে।","solution":["Leveling ও door zone sensor ঠিকমতো কাজ করছে কি না দেখুন।","Leveling plate-এর installation verticality ও depth দেখুন।","MCB-এর leveling signal input point গুলো দেখুন।","Steel rope slip করছে কি না দেখুন।"]}]}'::jsonb),
('nice-err51','{"description":"CAN communication অস্বাভাবিক","subcodes":[{"code":"101","description":"CTB-এর সাথে CANbus communication-এর feedback data ক্রমাগত ভুল।","solution":["Communication cable-এর সংযোগ দেখুন।","CTB-এর power supply দেখুন।","Controller-এর 24 V power supply normal কি না দেখুন।","Communication-এ strong-power interference আছে কি না দেখুন।"]}]}'::jsonb),
('nice-err52','{"description":"HCB (হল কল বোর্ড) communication অস্বাভাবিক","subcodes":[{"code":"101","description":"HCB-এর সাথে Modbus communication-এর feedback data ক্রমাগত ভুল।","solution":["Communication cable-এর সংযোগ দেখুন।","Controller-এর 24 V power supply normal কি না দেখুন।","HCB address পুনরাবৃত্তি (duplicate) হয়েছে কি না দেখুন।","Communication-এ strong-power interference আছে কি না দেখুন।"]}]}'::jsonb),
('nice-err53','{"description":"Door lock fault","subcodes":[{"code":"101","description":"Door open output দেওয়ার 3s পরও door lock feedback signal active থাকে।","solution":["Door lock circuit normal কি না দেখুন।","Door lock feedback সঠিক কি না দেখুন।"]},{"code":"102","description":"Door lock multi-way feedback contact-এর state অসামঞ্জস্যপূর্ণ, অথবা door lock 1 ও door lock 2-এর state অসামঞ্জস্যপূর্ণ।","solution":["Door lock circuit normal কি না দেখুন।","Door lock feedback সঠিক কি না দেখুন।"]},{"code":"105","description":"Door open-এর 3s পরে door lock circuit relay output দেওয়ার পরও door lock 1 shorting signal active।","solution":["Door lock circuit normal কি না দেখুন।","Door lock feedback সঠিক কি না দেখুন।"]},{"code":"106","description":"Door open-এর 3s পরে door lock circuit relay output দেওয়ার পরও door lock 2 shorting signal active।","solution":["Door lock circuit normal কি না দেখুন।","Door lock feedback সঠিক কি না দেখুন।"]},{"code":"104","description":"Higher-voltage ও low-voltage door lock signal অসামঞ্জস্যপূর্ণ।","solution":["Higher-voltage ও low-voltage door lock signal একই সময়ে শনাক্ত হলে, MCB দুটি signal পাওয়ার সময়ের পার্থক্য 1.5s-এর বেশি হয়।","এই sub code power-off করে আবার power-on করলে reset হয়।"]},{"code":"107","description":"Door lock shorting input বাছাই করা হয়েছে, কিন্তু feedback signal off থাকে বা disconnected।","solution":["Door lock shorting feedback-এর signal cable সংযুক্ত না থাকা বা ছিঁড়ে যাওয়া আছে কি না দেখুন।"]}]}'::jsonb),
('nice-err54','{"description":"Inspection startup-এ overcurrent","subcodes":[{"code":"102","description":"Inspection-এর startup-এ current rated current-এর 120% ছাড়িয়েছে।","solution":["Load কমান।","Motor phase sequence সঠিক কি না দেখুন।","Startup current detection ফাংশন বাতিল করতে FC-00-এর Bit1 কে 1 করুন।"]}]}'::jsonb),
('nice-err55','{"description":"অন্য landing floor-এ থামা","subcodes":[{"code":"101","description":"লিফটের automatic running-এর সময় Fb-06-এর time threshold-এর মধ্যে door open limit পাওয়া যায়নি।","solution":["বর্তমান ফ্লোরের door open limit signal পরীক্ষা করুন।"]}]}'::jsonb),
('nice-err56','{"description":"Door open/close signal fault","subcodes":[{"code":"101","description":"Running-এর সময় door open limit signal active।","solution":["F5-25-এ door open ও close-এর NO/NC সেটিং দেখুন।","Door open ও close signal-এর wiring দেখুন।"]},{"code":"102","description":"Running-এর সময় door close limit signal active।","solution":["F5-25-এ door open ও close-এর NO/NC সেটিং দেখুন।","Door open ও close signal-এর wiring দেখুন।"]},{"code":"103","description":"Door open ও close উভয় signal active।","solution":["F5-25-এ door open ও close-এর NO/NC সেটিং দেখুন।","Door open ও close signal-এর wiring দেখুন।"]},{"code":"104","description":"Door open-এর 3s পরেও door close limit signal active থাকে। Door lock bypass সেট করার পর এই fault sub code শনাক্ত হয়।","solution":["Door open/close limit signal ক্রমাগত active থাকছে কি না দেখুন।"]}]}'::jsonb),
('nice-err57','{"description":"Serial peripheral interface (SPI) communication অস্বাভাবিক","subcodes":[{"code":"101","description":"SPI communication অস্বাভাবিক।","solution":["Control board ও drive board-এর মধ্যে wiring পরীক্ষা করুন।"]},{"code":"102","description":"SPI communication অস্বাভাবিক।","solution":["Control board ও drive board-এর মধ্যে wiring পরীক্ষা করুন।"]},{"code":"103","description":"MCB, AC drive-এর সাথে মেলে না।","solution":["R&I team-এর সাথে যোগাযোগ করুন।"]}]}'::jsonb),
('nice-err58','{"description":"Shaft position switch অস্বাভাবিক","subcodes":[{"code":"101","description":"Up slow-down switch ও down slow-down switch একসাথে disconnected।","solution":["Slow-down switch ও limit switch-এর signal feature (NO, NC) MCB-এর parameter সেটিংয়ের সাথে সামঞ্জস্যপূর্ণ কি না দেখুন।","Slow-down switch ও limit switch-এ ত্রুটি (malfunction) আছে কি না দেখুন।"]},{"code":"102","description":"Up limit feedback ও down limit feedback একসাথে disconnected।","solution":["Slow-down switch ও limit switch-এর signal feature (NO, NC) MCB-এর parameter সেটিংয়ের সাথে সামঞ্জস্যপূর্ণ কি না দেখুন।","Slow-down switch ও limit switch-এ ত্রুটি (malfunction) আছে কি না দেখুন।"]}]}'::jsonb),
('nice-err59','{"description":"Reserved","solution":["কারণ: - | -"]}'::jsonb),
('nice-err60','{"description":"Reserved","solution":["কারণ: - | -"]}'::jsonb),
('nice-err61','{"description":"Reserved","solution":["কারণ: - | -"]}'::jsonb),
('nice-err62','{"description":"Analog input cable ছিঁড়ে গেছে","subcodes":[{"code":"101","description":"Analog input cable ছিঁড়ে গেছে।","solution":["F5-36 সঠিকভাবে সেট করা আছে কি না দেখুন।","CTB বা MCB-এর analog input cable ভুলভাবে সংযুক্ত বা ছিঁড়ে গেছে কি না দেখুন। Load cell switch ফাংশন সামঞ্জস্য করুন।"]}]}'::jsonb),
('nice-err63','{"description":"Special fault","solution":["কারণ: - | R&I team-এর সাথে যোগাযোগ করুন।"]}'::jsonb),
('nice-err64','{"description":"External fault","subcodes":[{"code":"101","description":"External fault signal 2s ধরে active থাকে।","solution":["External fault-এর NO/NC সেটিং দেখুন।","External fault signal-এর input state দেখুন।"]}]}'::jsonb),
('nice-err65','{"description":"UCMP (অনিচ্ছাকৃত কার চলাচল প্রতিরোধ) detection অস্বাভাবিক","solution":["কারণ: UCMP ফাংশন enabled থাকলে অথবা accidental car movement (অনিচ্ছাকৃত car চলাচল) ঘটলে এই fault জানানো হয়। | Motor brake সম্পূর্ণভাবে apply হয়েছে কি না এবং car accidentally নড়বে না তা নিশ্চিত করুন।"]}'::jsonb),
('nice-err66','{"description":"Braking force detection অস্বাভাবিক","solution":["কারণ: শনাক্ত braking force অপর্যাপ্ত। | Brake clearance পরীক্ষা করুন।"]}'::jsonb),
('nice-err74','{"description":"STO (সেফ টর্ক অফ) fault","subcodes":[{"code":"1","description":"STO fault","solution":["Safety circuit disconnected কি না দেখুন।","Door lock circuit disconnected কি না দেখুন।","Y1 output active কি না দেখুন।","STO card normal কি না দেখুন।"]}]}'::jsonb);

update public.wlf_troubleshooting t
   set content=jsonb_set(t.content||jsonb_build_object('bn',b.bn),'{revision}',to_jsonb(t.revision+1)),
       revision=t.revision+1
  from wlf_tb_bn b
 where t.id=b.id and t.content->'bn' is distinct from b.bn;

-- ---------------------------------------------------------------- RPC layer
do $layer$ begin
  if to_regprocedure('wlf_private.rpc_before_v250(text,jsonb)') is null then
    alter function wlf_private.rpc(text,jsonb) rename to rpc_before_v250;
  end if;
end $layer$;

create or replace function wlf_private.access_snapshot(x public.wlf_profiles) returns jsonb
language sql stable security definer set search_path='' as $$
  select jsonb_build_object('name',x.name,'empId',coalesce(x.employee_id,''),'section',coalesce(x.section,''),
    'role',x.role,'status',x.status,'permissions',to_jsonb(coalesce(x.permissions,'{}'::text[])))
$$;

create or replace function wlf_private.rpc(a text, args jsonb) returns jsonb
language plpgsql security definer set search_path='' as $$
declare
  p jsonb := coalesce(args->0,'{}');
  u public.wlf_profiles;
  before_row public.wlf_profiles;
  after_row public.wlf_profiles;
  req public.wlf_requests;
  result jsonb;
  diff jsonb;
  v_rev integer;
  v_yellow integer; v_red integer;
  v_key text;
begin
  u := wlf_private.me();
  if u.id is null or u.status is distinct from 'Approved' then
    raise exception 'SESSION_EXPIRED: Account is pending approval or inactive';
  end if;
  if octet_length(args::text)>100000 then raise exception 'Request too large'; end if;

  -- ---- push subscriptions (each user manages only their own devices)
  if a='savePushSubscription' then
    if coalesce(p->>'endpoint','') !~ '^https://' or length(p->>'endpoint')>1000
       or length(coalesce(p->>'p256dh','')) not between 20 and 200 or length(coalesce(p->>'auth','')) not between 8 and 100 then
      raise exception 'Invalid notification subscription';
    end if;
    insert into wlf_private.push_subscriptions(endpoint,profile,p256dh,auth,device)
    values(p->>'endpoint',u.id,p->>'p256dh',p->>'auth',left(coalesce(p->>'device',''),120))
    on conflict(endpoint) do update set profile=excluded.profile,p256dh=excluded.p256dh,auth=excluded.auth,device=excluded.device,created_at=now();
    delete from wlf_private.push_subscriptions where profile=u.id and endpoint in (
      select endpoint from wlf_private.push_subscriptions where profile=u.id order by created_at desc offset 10);
    return jsonb_build_object('devices',(select count(*) from wlf_private.push_subscriptions where profile=u.id));
  elsif a='deletePushSubscription' then
    delete from wlf_private.push_subscriptions where profile=u.id and endpoint=coalesce(p->>'endpoint','');
    return jsonb_build_object('devices',(select count(*) from wlf_private.push_subscriptions where profile=u.id));
  elsif a='getPushStatus' then
    return jsonb_build_object('publicKey',(select public_key from wlf_private.push_keys where id=1),
      'devices',(select count(*) from wlf_private.push_subscriptions where profile=u.id),
      'subscribed',coalesce(p->>'endpoint','')<>'' and exists(select 1 from wlf_private.push_subscriptions where profile=u.id and endpoint=p->>'endpoint'));

  -- ---- change history
  elsif a='getUserAccessLog' then
    if u.role<>'Super Admin' then raise exception 'Permission denied: Super Admin only'; end if;
    select * into after_row from public.wlf_profiles where email=lower(btrim(coalesce(p->>'email','')));
    if not found then raise exception 'User not found'; end if;
    return coalesce((select jsonb_agg(jsonb_build_object('at',l.at,
        'by',case when l.actor is null then '' else coalesce(wlf_private.person_label(l.actor),'') end,
        'changes',l.changes) order by l.at desc, l.id desc)
      from (select * from wlf_private.access_log where target=after_row.id order by at desc, id desc limit 200) l),'[]'::jsonb);

  -- ---- old-request colours
  elsif a='saveSupportAging' then
    if u.role<>'Super Admin' then raise exception 'Permission denied: Super Admin only'; end if;
    v_yellow := nullif(p->>'yellowDays','')::integer; v_red := nullif(p->>'redDays','')::integer;
    if v_yellow is null or v_red is null or v_yellow not between 1 and 365 or v_red not between 1 and 365 or v_red<=v_yellow then
      raise exception 'Enter whole days: yellow 1-365 and red greater than yellow.';
    end if;
    insert into public.wlf_settings(key,value) values('supportAging',jsonb_build_object('yellowDays',v_yellow,'redDays',v_red))
    on conflict(key) do update set value=excluded.value;
    return jsonb_build_object('yellowDays',v_yellow,'redDays',v_red);

  elsif a='saveAppUserAccess' then
    select * into before_row from public.wlf_profiles where email=lower(btrim(coalesce(p->>'email','')));
  elsif a='transitionSupportRequest' and p->>'action'='forward' then
    select revision into v_rev from public.wlf_requests where id=nullif(p->>'id','')::uuid;
  end if;

  result := wlf_private.rpc_before_v250(a,args);

  if a='saveAppUserAccess' and before_row.id is not null then
    select * into after_row from public.wlf_profiles where id=before_row.id;
    diff := '{}'::jsonb;
    foreach v_key in array array['name','empId','section','role','status'] loop
      if wlf_private.access_snapshot(before_row)->>v_key is distinct from wlf_private.access_snapshot(after_row)->>v_key then
        diff := diff||jsonb_build_object(v_key,jsonb_build_object('from',wlf_private.access_snapshot(before_row)->>v_key,'to',wlf_private.access_snapshot(after_row)->>v_key));
      end if;
    end loop;
    if exists(select unnest(after_row.permissions) except select unnest(before_row.permissions)) then
      diff := diff||jsonb_build_object('added',(select jsonb_agg(k order by k) from (select unnest(after_row.permissions) k except select unnest(before_row.permissions)) x));
    end if;
    if exists(select unnest(before_row.permissions) except select unnest(after_row.permissions)) then
      diff := diff||jsonb_build_object('removed',(select jsonb_agg(k order by k) from (select unnest(before_row.permissions) k except select unnest(after_row.permissions)) x));
    end if;
    if diff<>'{}'::jsonb then
      insert into wlf_private.access_log(actor,target,changes) values(u.id,after_row.id,diff);
    end if;
  elsif a='transitionSupportRequest' and p->>'action'='forward' then
    select * into req from public.wlf_requests where id=nullif(p->>'id','')::uuid;
    if req.id is not null and req.status='Forwarded' and req.assigned_to is not null and req.revision is distinct from v_rev then
      perform wlf_private.push_enqueue(req.assigned_to, 'Support request forwarded to you',
        req.reference||' · '||initcap(replace(req.category,'-',' '))||' · from '||coalesce(wlf_private.person_label(u.id),u.name),
        './#technical');
    end if;
  elsif a in ('getSession','getAppContext') then
    result := result||jsonb_build_object('build','2.5.0',
      'supportAging',coalesce((select value from public.wlf_settings where key='supportAging'),'{"yellowDays":2,"redDays":3}'::jsonb),
      'pushPublicKey',(select public_key from wlf_private.push_keys where id=1),
      'accessLog',true,'troubleshootingBangla',true);
  elsif a='getSupportWorkspace' then
    result := result||jsonb_build_object('supportAging',
      coalesce((select value from public.wlf_settings where key='supportAging'),'{"yellowDays":2,"redDays":3}'::jsonb));
  end if;
  return result;
end
$$;

-- ---------------------------------------------------------------- grants
revoke all on function wlf_private.rpc_before_v250(text,jsonb) from public, anon, authenticated;
revoke all on function wlf_private.rpc(text,jsonb) from public, anon;
grant execute on function wlf_private.rpc(text,jsonb) to authenticated;
revoke all on function wlf_private.access_snapshot(public.wlf_profiles) from public, anon, authenticated;
revoke all on function wlf_private.push_enqueue(uuid,text,text,text) from public, anon, authenticated;
revoke all on function wlf_private.push_new_request() from public, anon, authenticated;

notify pgrst, 'reload schema';
commit;

-- ---------------------------------------------------------------- check
select
  to_regclass('wlf_private.access_log') is not null as change_history_ready,
  to_regclass('wlf_private.push_outbox') is not null
    and exists(select 1 from pg_trigger where tgname='wlf_push_new_request') as push_ready,
  exists(select 1 from public.wlf_settings where key='supportAging') as support_colours_ready,
  not exists(select 1 from public.wlf_ri_categories where schema::text like '%"Canceled"%')
    and not exists(select 1 from public.wlf_ri_entries where status='Canceled') as cancelled_spelling_fixed,
  (select count(*) from public.wlf_troubleshooting where content ? 'bn') as bangla_entries,
  to_regprocedure('wlf_private.rpc_before_v250(text,jsonb)') is not null as v250_rules_ready;
